{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52010","headline":"春庄走笔 · 王绩","name":"春庄走笔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野客元图静，田家本恶諠。\n枕山通箘阁，临磵创茅轩。\n约略栽新柳，随宜作小园。\n草依三径合，花接四隣繁。\n野妇调中馈，山朋促上樽。\n晓羹犹未糁，春酒不须温。\n卖药开东铺，租田向北村。\n梦中逢栎社，醉里觅桃源。\n猪肝时入馔，犊鼻即裁褌。\n自觉勳名薄，方知道义尊。\n所嗟同志少，无处可忘言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52010.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52010","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}